[{"title":"尤美轩","author":"汪应辰","text":"巉然绝壑临招提，仰视疑欲干晴霓。\n林峦献状还左右，烟云变相随高低。\n少日登高不惮远，喘汗赪颜如夏畦。\n却凭轩槛认行处，一览不待穷攀跻。\n爱山愿作此轩客，饥火驱出仍东西。\n青衫乌帽犯尘土，梦想春绿浮凫鹥。\n归寻舟刻剑已往，扁榜仅能存旧题。\n道人知我若有失，更附山房拂栱梯。\n方欣胜观还昔时，忽讶妙语来磻溪。\n茫茫六合有安宅，恍悟十年行路迷。\n甘与山僧为逆旅，自使妇姑相勃溪。\n暗明通壅悉还汝，无所还者吾其栖。\n但惭屋上复加屋，空费囊中金袅蹄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72799,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归云堂","author":"汪应辰","text":"浮云本无心，人心逐云去。\n更作归云堂，云归竟何处。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72800,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再用前韵","author":"汪应辰","text":"驾言写我忧，一览无边春。\n先生方闭户，不可得而亲。\n宁逐儿女戏，要观物化新。\n不见舞雩下，冠者五六人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72801,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"曾谹父约游南岩短韵奉呈","author":"王洋","text":"南丰不藏善，逢人说南岩。\n南岩亦何好，造物秘此缄。\n烟云卬全提，松竹色半酣。\n去郭十里赢，守戒僧二三。\n乞身满一日，幽事亦可探。\n行客问征途，居者萦辔衔。\n萧条野店烟，夐静弥勒龛。\n念非尘外侣，谁分禅味甘。\n受佣作闲人，自缚亦可惭。\n于时日在房，山色染霭蓝。\n一径盘郁青，群峰列空嵌。\n吟泉计涓滴，瀹鼎消尘凡。\n端如常德静，可警疾步贪。\n扬镳出云门，回首怜烟岚。\n公其吐妙语，胜事须指南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72802,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"复次数语呈知止","author":"汪应辰","text":"斯道有张弛，如天有冬春。\n雍容贵可久，促迫终难亲。\n槁蘖久乃腐，流水汲逾新。\n虽云不窥圃，乘马复何人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72803,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"借舍人吕丈送大雅东还诗韵奉呈","author":"汪应辰","text":"典刑寄老成，师友须渊源。\n今代紫薇公，身退道益尊。\n言行无表襮，卓然中所存。\n云雨自翻覆，谁能动毫分。\n洗垢既无垢，尚或求瘢痕。\n嗟我与徐子，昔也扫公门。\n相期膏吾车，从公毕斯文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72804,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题法海院龙溪亭","author":"汪应辰","text":"微茫云两角，屈曲路一线。\n未容快先睹，已叹行百转。\n流溪何从来，神物昔尝玩。\n舆梁俨坚牢，亭宇复明绚。\n岂惟济病涉，更可供息宴。\n信哉善知识，作此巧方便。\n茂樾两交盖，清风四挥扇。\n祇恐境中人，却有桑下恋。\n台山不须问，此去直如箭。\n何妨酌灵水，一洗眼花眩。\n举头未及眸，已知梵王殿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72805,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题郑氏籯金堂","author":"汪应辰","text":"子云抱遗经，寂寞饥欲死。\n谁家千金郎，车马塞闾里。\n如何今世人，持此欲胜彼。\n要知圣贤心，不为取青紫。\n冷暖自所知，吾言聊尔尔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72806,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"汪应辰","text":"龙爪拿开白白云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72807,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵武侯庙","author":"汪应晦","text":"武侯遗庙自丹青，霸业销磨但故城。\n北魏中分盟血在，南阳三顾夙心明。\n君臣际会宜兴汉，吴蜀相资失借荆。\n独致瓣香思祀典，西山回首暮云生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72808,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"烂柯山","author":"汪忱","text":"山作危梁千尺横，一天金泛月波清。\n幽禽不复惊棋响，深谷犹能答斧声。\n塔坏尚馀鸿雁意，井荒谁放辘轳鸣。\n试将比较天台景，只欠璁珑琪树英。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72809,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题昭明庙","author":"汪远猷","text":"生为明哲没为神，一点英灵著处新。\n秋浦溪山最留意，法华禅定是前身。\n九州托庇阴功大，六字加封宠渥频。\n更有使君书事实，幽沉从此愈昭伸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72810,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"十一月宿于潜","author":"汪宗臣","text":"蜂迷蜜瓮朮丝香，蚁泛花瓷碧玉浆。\n县僻人稀寒日晚，古松樛翠出危墙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72811,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"半山寺","author":"汪宗臣","text":"往事空求佛，当年误买邻。\n悠悠思舐犊，烟雨暗松筠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72812,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚望","author":"汪宗臣","text":"野岸松杉暝色沉，渔翁收钓碧潭深。\n冲云点点鹭飞疾，何处呼牛尚远林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72813,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"燕雁","author":"汪宗臣","text":"秋来春去雁宾熟，秋去春来燕子忙。\n寒暑自分人事信，不须禽类互炎凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72814,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谒云蓝山先越公墓","author":"汪宗臣","text":"此生未展云蓝墓，郁郁甘棠孙子情。\n今度忽为寒食客，欣欣乔木岁时荣。\n尧天日月重光显，越国江山几变更。\n回首千年有归鹤，练溪新涨匝春城。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72815,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"稼穑","author":"汪宗臣","text":"稼穑病多雨，芜菁种待晴。\n垒空惊燕去，池净衬鸥明。\n野碓鸣秋杵，风檐响夜筝。\n山中凉意早，蚊蚋已无声。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72816,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乙亥避地横槎山中","author":"汪宗臣","text":"仙槎移到此，杳杳白云根。\n石乳漏崖响，山腰界雨昏。\n径幽盘过险，桥断涉惊浑。\n百匝回峰曲，数家临水村。\n芋瓜青绕屋，桑柘绿当门。\n鹘突儿迎客，龙钟叟抱孙。\n涧舂分注沼，田穫半樊园。\n地僻衣巾古，人稀耕凿温。\n尚怀文杏馆，且拟小桃源。\n岭外风波别，摇头勿复言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72817,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冲陶山中","author":"汪宗臣","text":"侵床绿意多，过牖松花落。\n草堂一编诗，送客不下阁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72818,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吊鹤集诗句","author":"汪宗臣","text":"有鹤在林，翙翙其鸣。\n风雨所漂摇，求其友生。\n不狩不猎，麾之以肱。\n宛其死矣，宁莫之惩。\n英英白云，毋金玉尔音。\n如可赎兮，实劳我心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72819,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"金陵凤凰台","author":"汪宗臣","text":"龙虎势称雄，凤凰台望浓。\n潮翻江汉转，地扼楚淮冲。\n平野频烽火，孤城半稑穜。\n丹楹傍萧寺，尘扆识高宗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72820,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"鸿门舞剑歌","author":"汪宗臣","text":"黑云压垒骓嘶风，荆轲聂政粗豪同。\n舞筵闪动青蛇影，焉知火帝生真龙。\n一剑剡剡匹夫勇，一剑翼翼随西东。\n壮士长戈气罥虹，扫开霾曀曦光融。\n尊前张胆不为屈，生彘脔割吞群凶。\n子房笑语指顾顷，奚啻脱车深淖中。\n平阳帝谱炎精动，玉蜿蜒夜当其锋。\n秦关恍服汤武出，赤帜弥张天下雄。\n金刀赫灵汉剑奋，乌江落日楚剑空。\n美人没草骓没水，项庄何处鸣秋蛩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72821,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘲贾似道","author":"汪宗臣","text":"贾秋壑，魏公爵，台州鬼，扬州鹤。\n气盈色骄逞才略，欺天罔人无愧怍。\n帷幄不能筹，金汤弗能作。\n费尽世间铁，铸此一大错。\n关子形模贾字同，生儿德祐纪元中。\n甚惭婴杵心莽卓，十可斩书真谔谔。\n锣声三下东江头，铁鞭一挥南海角。\n假贾伪魏至于斯，呜呼似道道奚若。\n宋亡感激忠义多，遗臭如君枭獍恶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72822,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新秋池上晓望","author":"汪宗臣","text":"净植香来水北，残蝉声度桥东。\n清沚金鳞漾绿，夕阳白鹭翻红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72823,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 冬至","author":"汪宗臣","text":"候应黄钟动，吹出白葭灰。\n五云重压头上，潜蛰地中雷。\n莫道希声妙寂，嶰竹雄鸣合凤，九寸律初裁。\n欲识天心处，请问学颜回。\n冷中温，穷时达，信然哉。\n彩云山外如画，送上笔尖来。\n一气先通关窍，万物旋生头角，谁合又谁开。\n官路春光早，箫落数枝梅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72824,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满江红 春雨","author":"汪宗臣","text":"检点春光，阴雨过、三分之一。\n从头数、元宵灯夕，都无晴日。\n不碍郊原肥草绿，但漫丘壑沈云黑。\n那东君、忒煞没纲维，春无力。\n燕忙甚，泥浑湿。\n蜂愁甚，脾无蜜。\n更两旬又是，梨花寒食。\n蔫红殷桃吾不较，岂堪浸烂东畴麦。\n望前村、白鹭衬霞红，探晴色。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72825,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酹江月/念奴娇 题乌江项羽庙","author":"汪宗臣","text":"白蛇宵断，逐鹿人、交趁罾鱼群起。\n赤帜雄张军缟素，龙种天生大器。\n堪鄙猴冠，自为狼藉，楚帐多尘垒。\n胆寒垓下，一鞭东窜休矣。\n亭长空舣扁舟，范增群辈，尽涂脂流髓。\n望断秦关无限恨，羞面江东山水。\n购首千金，若为名利，黯黯斜阳里。\n石炉灰冷，美人魂落烟翠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72826,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蝶恋花 清明前两日闻燕","author":"汪宗臣","text":"年去年来来去早。\n怪底不来，庭院春光老。\n知过谁家翻别调。\n家家望断飞踪窅。\n千里潇湘烟渺渺。\n不记雕梁，旧日恩多少。\n匝近清明檐外叫。\n故巢犹在朱檐晓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72827,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题共乐堂","author":"汪泌","text":"临海城东湖，气象清且奇。\n无风绿色净，十顷澄琉璃。\n中有共乐堂，今其名者谁。\n人有答我问，太守下车时。\n访民所疾苦，民曰水最危。\n其水或暴至，城坏民流尸。\n公谋得上策，叠石完城基。\n外遗数百家，室屋鳞参差。\n水至无所障，适与漂溺期。\n又欲堤其东，苦乏土石资。\n开湖足取用，堤势横虹蜺。\n湖光占空阔，物从鉴中窥。\n紫翠前后山，环列如屏帷。\n构堂就虚旷，与俗同游嬉。\n太守宴堂上，游人歌水湄。\n歌云从公来，除患补疮痍。\n况有此观壮，不乐何以为。\n有如登春台，人心举熙熙。\n从事能文者，作辞书之碑。\n庶其不朽功，上彻尧轩墀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72828,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三洪遗墨石刻 其一","author":"汪炎昶","text":"弟兄落落峙雄名，字落青珉定有灵。\n地下可能□□剑，人间喜似出兰亭。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72829,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三洪遗墨石刻 其二","author":"汪炎昶","text":"物殊寿夭故难知，谁欲宽为久远期。\n尘土未能昏故楮，泥沙先已蚀残碑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72830,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"中彝兄于余至厚奄隔幽明因过其门追悼口述","author":"汪炎昶","text":"山色花香总是愁，当年此地几同游。\n偶来恍似君犹在，足拟过门却复休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72831,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"先世藏减笔画马甚精妙因乱失之追悼赋此","author":"汪炎昶","text":"老韩妙笔见无由，一马长鸣塞草秋。\n败素烟昏谁解惜，盐车犹自困骅骝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72832,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹径","author":"汪炎昶","text":"竹阴清入骨，消得此闲行。\n不待锄苍藓，频来径自成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72833,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访人不遇 其一","author":"汪炎昶","text":"寥寥空谷嘘紫霞，谁知此有幽人家。\n洞门深锁苍藓滑，风藤簌簌吹残花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72834,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初冬","author":"汪炎昶","text":"城头钟断漏初长，布被寒生一夜霜。\n已剧凄凉犹似较，后来风色更凄凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72835,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沧洲白鹭图五首 其四","author":"汪炎昶","text":"联拳一足傍菰蒲，照影秋波雪点孤。\n荷响滴残篷外雨，远应有梦落江湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72836,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沧洲白鹭图五首 其三","author":"汪炎昶","text":"遥空几见落斜行，多在蘋汀蓼岸傍。\n认得耸身烟雨态，数声相伴戛斜阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72837,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沧洲白鹭图五首 其二","author":"汪炎昶","text":"云影天光匝钓矶，毰毸微展雪毛衣。\n不知妙得天然趣，只道惊人意欲飞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72838,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沧洲白鹭图五首 其一","author":"汪炎昶","text":"画角声中意欲迷，酒阑客思晚凄凄。\n恍然生我红尘外，满眼沧洲白鹭栖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72839,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉和江冲陶隐居二十韵 其八","author":"汪炎昶","text":"割云石棱铦，缠藤松骨槁。\n少华且未登，昌黎应绝倒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72840,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉和江冲陶隐居二十韵 其四","author":"汪炎昶","text":"青冥风露凄，玉笙浮缥缈。\n石藓蚀秋花，萝月淡清晓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72841,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉和江冲陶隐居二十韵 其十四","author":"汪炎昶","text":"以我鼻端气，观此石间风。\n理固未易辨，妙处要相同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72842,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客归二首 其二","author":"汪炎昶","text":"腊瓮香浓未遣开，琴书先自扑尘埃。\n偶然俗事都忘却，似有微凉拂面来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72843,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客归二首 其一","author":"汪炎昶","text":"绕墙烟树色茏葱，燕入莺过路不通。\n客子归来误惊喜，移家别住绿阴中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72844,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春寒","author":"汪炎昶","text":"漠漠阴云匝地垂，年年怯过禁烟时。\n晓风幸自浑无力，柳外微微弄酒旗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72845,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"种蓼","author":"汪炎昶","text":"莫道山家浑索寞，化工原不鄙山家。\n却须豫作秋光地，自向窗前种蓼花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72846,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"汪炎昶","text":"树借看书影，蝉供隐几声。\n人稀忘屋小，地净觉凉生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72847,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哭直方兄二首 其二","author":"汪炎昶","text":"今人万事欲心灰，忧患君曾遍历来。\n亲戚送将山下去，归来一饷哭声哀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72848,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哭直方兄二首 其一","author":"汪炎昶","text":"到门忽怪不相迎，堂上惊闻有哭声。\n始悟已非生死隔，几年来往弟兼兄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72849,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶忆徽外琴声妙入神之句而失记为何人诗爱其善于模写琴声沉吟数过是夕梦一伟丈夫为余鼓琴音调清越非复世所常闻因以纪之","author":"汪炎昶","text":"伟甚衣冠貌特奇，数声清越弄瑶徽。\n尚求人世知音听，地下钟期可亦稀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72850,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晦庵先生遗墨 其一","author":"汪炎昶","text":"刊除浮习语丁宁，洙泗馀风刮地清。\n孔李通家争几许，当时独未作门生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72851,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晦庵先生遗墨 其二","author":"汪炎昶","text":"久远知谁更解珍，即今犹见墨如新。\n难怀白璧归秦国，尚喜乌嘷属楚人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72852,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"梅子","author":"汪炎昶","text":"又是江南烟雨时，黄梅正解蹙人眉。\n平生谩说和羹事，一骑红尘属荔枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72853,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕明日次退翁韵","author":"汪炎昶","text":"牵牛织女定虚传，快意惟须向目前。\n仰腹晒书真自苦，挂裈随俗底须然。\n长生殿冷新蛩咽，乞巧楼空破月悬。\n何不昨宵来就我，嫩凉恰与醉相便。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72854,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"友人山庄","author":"汪炎昶","text":"便觉尘嚣隔，烟霞宁几深。\n树招怜翠眼，水发嗜清心。\n石晕团枯靥，崖芳簇碎金。\n知非樽酒聚，宠我以幽寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72855,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"壬辰冬识孙元京于郡城剧谈甚得因约余至其家已而不果明年春早闻已下世哭以诗","author":"汪炎昶","text":"屈指惊前辈，春来倍感伤。\n斯文虽未坠，此老复云亡。\n更觉新诗重，逾思别话长。\n相知谁遣晚，旧约堕苍茫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72856,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬至 其二","author":"汪炎昶","text":"山家律琯在寒梅，香袭幽窗报乍开。\n客梦并随残夜尽，乡心潜傍一阳回。\n幡垂稍喜春当近，竹爆先惊腊又催。\n从此东风无限绿，不妨吹上鬒毛来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72857,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"记蝗","author":"汪炎昶","text":"饥疫灾方息，飞蝗又作群。\n搅空吹密雪，障日度轻云。\n濒死欣才脱，偷生骇乍闻。\n分官严捕瘗，吏卒日纷纷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72858,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次友韵","author":"汪炎昶","text":"达人忧乐但随时，往事犹须入梦思。\n实行难磨姑致力，空言无补莫耽诗。\n水终易起渹风浪，松暂微低偃雪枝。\n李在道傍遭众弃，兰生谷底有人知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72859,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次早再入山用前韵","author":"汪炎昶","text":"苔深行爱软，藤曲挽惊长。\n松健根挐石，花繁树向阳。\n屦香沾药气，衣腻染岚光。\n病骨凛清意，无风亦自凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72860,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵戏族兄存耕翁再纳宠姬 其一","author":"汪炎昶","text":"买得轻盈一树春，画堂歌舞又翻新。\n慈乌哺母情兼洽，彩凤将雏色总珍。\n?鬌应梳云作髻，婵娟想琢玉为人。\n素知静婉矜佳丽，肯向罗敷意独亲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72861,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵约登里中莲花峰","author":"汪炎昶","text":"青莲界敞白云巅，乘兴难追雪夜船。\n孰肯忘怀当闹处，人当慕道向中年。\n即翻贝叶吾犹倦，更策筇枝子亦贤。\n可是此生凡骨重，丹梯无计一攀缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72862,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵游龙潭","author":"汪炎昶","text":"我谩怀清赏，君誇是胜游。\n倦犹攀鸟道，渴欲饮龙湫。\n墨客工传信，山灵觊阐幽。\n敢云希作者，强把记文修。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":72863,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]